- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated.
- **IDs:** `glm-4.5-flash`, `opencode/glm-4.5-flash`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens total (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free on Zen; $0.00/$0.00 on Z.ai developer platform (local metadata/pricing page lists GLM-4.5-Flash as free).
- **Architecture:** Lightweight/distilled variant relative to flagship GLM-4.5 per metadata; detailed architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed in accessible sources.

